Match data to March 2024 comes from Bhuvanesh Prasad's "Test Cricket Matches Dataset
(1877 - 2024)" on Kaggle
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bhuvaneshprasad/test-matches-dataset-1877-2023),
used under the Apache License 2.0; a copy of that licence is in
data/LICENSE-kaggle-dataset.txt. The file data/test_matches_kaggle.csv is
redistributed unchanged.

Later match data comes from Cricsheet (https://cricsheet.org) and is used under
the Open Data Commons Attribution License (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/).

Both datasets remain under their own licences. Scores and results are facts and are not
claimed here.
